Source: ubgp
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ubgp contributors <nuclearcat@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/nuclearcat/ubgp
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ubgp
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: announce-only BGP daemon with mandatory export ACLs
 Exports permitted kernel prefixes from selected Linux routing tables to
 directly connected eBGP and iBGP neighbors. Never installs received routes.
 Includes IPv4 and IPv6, TCP-MD5 authentication, and a read-only console.
